{"1794000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Remnants of R'lyeh", "steam_appid": 1794000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794000/extras/87c6c96a843cc61d3c25ecb0900f8644.poster.avif?t=1784042674\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794000/extras/87c6c96a843cc61d3c25ecb0900f8644.webm?t=1784042674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794000/extras/87c6c96a843cc61d3c25ecb0900f8644.mp4?t=1784042674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remnants of R’lyeh</strong> is a first-person survival horror experience set deep beneath the waves — where madness slumbers, and ancient nightmares stir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the mythos of H.P. Lovecraft, <i>Remnants of R’lyeh</i> thrusts players into the mind of Jason, a deep-sea diver haunted by a disastrous expedition and drawn into a decaying city lost to time and sanity. Trapped in the abyss, Jason must navigate a biomechanical world powered by the flesh of sea monsters, uncover twisted secrets, and confront grotesque abominations born of cosmic terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a labyrinthine steampunk metropolis teetering on the edge of reality — where rusted gears grind alongside flesh-bound machines, and the boundary between dream and death collapses. Armed with scavenged weapons and limited sanity, survival hinges on your ability to fight, hide, and piece together a story that was never meant to be told.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Lovecraftian nightmare brought to life with haunting visuals and immersive environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seamless blend of horror, shooter, and exploration mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sinister AI-driven enemies that evolve with your fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly detailed, linear yet atmospheric deep-sea world inspired by <i>Bioshock</i> and <i>Silent Hill</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological descent into madness with sanity-based narrative progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the depths. Face the unknowable. Escape, if you can — but remember: some things should stay buried...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794000/extras/87c6c96a843cc61d3c25ecb0900f8644.poster.avif?t=1784042674\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794000/extras/87c6c96a843cc61d3c25ecb0900f8644.webm?t=1784042674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794000/extras/87c6c96a843cc61d3c25ecb0900f8644.mp4?t=1784042674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remnants of R’lyeh</strong> is a first-person survival horror experience set deep beneath the waves — where madness slumbers, and ancient nightmares stir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the mythos of H.P. Lovecraft, <i>Remnants of R’lyeh</i> thrusts players into the mind of Jason, a deep-sea diver haunted by a disastrous expedition and drawn into a decaying city lost to time and sanity. Trapped in the abyss, Jason must navigate a biomechanical world powered by the flesh of sea monsters, uncover twisted secrets, and confront grotesque abominations born of cosmic terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a labyrinthine steampunk metropolis teetering on the edge of reality — where rusted gears grind alongside flesh-bound machines, and the boundary between dream and death collapses. Armed with scavenged weapons and limited sanity, survival hinges on your ability to fight, hide, and piece together a story that was never meant to be told.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Lovecraftian nightmare brought to life with haunting visuals and immersive environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seamless blend of horror, shooter, and exploration mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sinister AI-driven enemies that evolve with your fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly detailed, linear yet atmospheric deep-sea world inspired by <i>Bioshock</i> and <i>Silent Hill</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological descent into madness with sanity-based narrative progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the depths. Face the unknowable. Escape, if you can — but remember: some things should stay buried...</p>", "short_description": "Inspired by H.P. Lovecraft's Great Work. An ancient dark power is calling you and you need to find an exit. Face your greatest fear, fight, hide... you must escape before the underwater city rises...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The underwater section is probably the strongest, but both sections have some great environments to explore, the puzzles are interesting and the monsters are very freaky. It’s shaping up to be a great blend of Lovecraftian horror and survival horror well worth diving into.”<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br><br>“I enjoyed it :) keep up the good work!”<br>IGP<br>", "h